    "evidence_level": "oracle-compared",
    "statement": "Development target, not a completed support claim. The repository ActiveRecord provider (parseActiveRecordModels, ingestion t10-provider in the persistence catalog) is compared with the schema facts that ActiveRecord 8.1.4 reports for the same fixture models once each fixture db/schema.rb is loaded into an in-memory SQLite database. Constructs marked supported match that oracle for the listed facets on the listed fixtures at the pinned version; every other construct is listed with how the provider omits, leaves unknown or mishandles it. Nothing was run against a server database, a Rails application or a migration tool."
  },
